+Face-adjacent neighbors are accessed by modifying the linear index based on face direction enums [S1, unofficial]:
+*   **Left/Right (X-axis)**: `idx - 1` or `idx + 1`
+*   **Back/Front (Y-axis)**: `idx - N_x` or `idx + N_x`
+*   **Bottom/Top (Z-axis)**: `idx - (N_x \cdot N_y)` or `idx + (N_x \cdot N_y)`
 
-*   **Left Face** ($-x$): $idx_{left} = idx_{curr} - 1$
